WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.870
Multi-select: pick up to fifteen separate pieces of a page, in the order you want them.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:25.080
Drag over words. Click a picture, a shape or any block. Ctrl+click a line to take the whole line.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:32.700
Picked too much? Click the number to drop that pick, or "Undo pick" for the last one.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.540
Copy (Ctrl+C or Enter) puts them on the clipboard, stacked in pick order - with formatting for Word, Outlook and Teams.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:42.380
Or park them in Transit: the holding area for content on its way to another page or another app.

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:48.833
Transit keeps pictures, links and formatting. Esc closes it; it waits for you between sessions.

